! ============================================================================
! twol/capitalization.twol — sentence-initial capital handling
!
! NOTE: kept for reference. The actual case-folding is done with a small
! xfst/regex transducer (see Makefile target *.automorf.hfst) because a
! flag-free uppercase->lowercase mapping on the analysis side is cleaner as a
! composed regex than as two-level rules. This file documents the intent.
! ============================================================================
